!!!Run pip install using requirements.txt to collect all required packages before running main and trainer scripts!!!!

Trainer is the code for training the models based on both SVM and BERT. 

Trained models are saved on a separate folder in save directory.

Main.py invokes the models to do the prediction on track file containing the test data and returns a array with a subset of emotions implied in each row of track csv file represented by either '1' to denote presence of emotion and '0' to denote absence.

Going to try distilBERT to cut down the size of trained model since it's exceeding permitted upload size of 200MB in ILIAS

